{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6da6e5d8d0eea98e3f594eacbe41df1aa810fc23403b15a19826d43b367faa07","ja":"ラグジュアリーな日々","zh":"奢华的日子","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"87517c2977ec010d47ab551f3748f1927d54ae4bf55d0b4c7fddc3796a83cbd8","ja":"お腹いっぱ～い♪　なんでしたっけ、呪文みたいな\n名前のお料理、とっても美味しかったですね！","zh":"吃得好～饱♪　叫什么来着，那个像念咒一样\n名字的菜肴，非常美味呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ccb4f42cedf3c9ba2e04b5b5bf6538652edc4d28b94bbf1963f273b70d493353","ja":"ふふ、オシャレなフレンチだったね。\nどれも深みがある味で……♪","zh":"呵呵，那家法餐真时髦呢。\n每道菜的味道都很有层次感……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1a773fa45b397131a1db9965acf9a42b2a7633b4b231585df9bc0d35fbbcedf6","ja":"ええ、滅多に味わえないので思わず感動して……。","zh":"是的，因为很难得能尝到，所以情不自禁感动了起来……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"2537291226922e2ca769e45639a74dbd5cd460994daf727fda4b52ff243370cf","ja":"……はっ！　わ、我が家のシェフとは\nまた違った味わいでしたわ！","zh":"……哈！与、与我们家厨师做的\n又是截然不同的风味呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3b54b438aabd6c321be6415a62fdeb15e82797a0e46e4a96676cf2ef62b06f7c","ja":"さすが高級ホテル。\nお部屋もお料理もサービスも、極上ですわね！","zh":"不愧是高级酒店。\n无论是房间、佳肴还是服务，全都无可挑剔呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"039f6d4cc4360e737198defb18d2e5edc46b7cd1e66cde40808dfcf8b696f9bc","ja":"そういえば、夜景がよく見えるジャグジーの\n露天風呂もあるそうよ。後で行ってみましょう♪","zh":"话说回来，听说这里还有能将夜景尽收眼底的按摩\n露天温泉哦。待会儿一起去看看吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"1bb011bf8fea165273efaca5003ecbae90fbb0e707d8dd9982148e1ea8ce0845","ja":"なんと……！\nふふ、夢見心地の時間が続きそうですね。","zh":"居然……！\n呵呵，宛如身处梦境般的时光似乎还要继续呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"149b3a2555d1cb98c328e97bdf3c78f9de57523713f47cd4e5b4724566791f6f","ja":"そして数日後……","zh":"然后几天后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"e2c77e53d07fc55e25e4ec061b2039b0fa4d8edcd72a86a4a2c7e35e14508c9d","ja":"ふぅ、今日もごちそうだったね。本当にどれも\nおいしくて。でも、なんだか落ち着かない気も……。","zh":"呼，今天也是大餐一顿呢。真的道道\n都很好吃。不过，总觉得有点静不下心来……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"243b93c2a7d8e7b347876a275fc65703e53049fb06445603ff3cff1efd252b64","ja":"そうですわね。何日も続くと、無性にお母さ……\n我が家のシェフの味が懐かしくなってきましたわ。","zh":"确实呢。连续这么好多天，我不禁想念起妈妈……\n想念起我们家大厨的手艺了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"a78d631c72609d36e2538a2a08f7e6237954a3414f588f270027eef99f2f2bee","ja":"千鶴もですか？　実は私も……劇場で食べる\n出前の大盛りらーめんが恋しくなってきたところです。","zh":"千鹤也是吗？其实我也……正开始想念\n在剧场叫外卖吃的大碗拉面了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"f5c65699b8acbd61b1a8d06bf5d98fb1abd0c0c78e822cde89f78090c470e4d5","ja":"……きゃあああああーーっ！？","zh":"……呀啊啊啊啊啊——！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"9083517d74993ddfec4229285855d7dab2bb1cab8ee773f80dc355999faded52","ja":"どうしたんですか、あずささん？\n急に大きな声を出して。","zh":"梓小姐，怎么了吗？\n突然发出这么大的声音。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"46dc39938287b58b464ccf09d5571bdfb53ef8cb1d1138bbe0beb7db7f3126da","ja":"あっ、ごめんなさい。その、\n体重計に乗ったら、見たことない数字が出てきて……。","zh":"啊，对不起。那个，\n站上体重秤后，出现了一个从没见过的数字……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"e61771bb0d478847ac7f311e60fa9b51652714a69f83086891be36ad5e35d8cb","ja":"美味しい物、食べすぎちゃったみたい……。\nホテル暮らしが続くのも考え物ね。","zh":"好吃的好像吃太多了……\n一直住在酒店里也得好好反思一下呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"1dd4b50f5948699f3d9a3a913048940dba4b030d1211d5067f877b939a0dbc2a","ja":"麗花ちゃんは、今の生活は問題ないのかしら？","zh":"丽花现在的生活没什么问题吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"17e454328e3706a482b29a93dd4ba9792a49b30e2b7a89e11bf81907ee14f3aa","ja":"はい♪　……あ、でも、お家の鍵をちゃんと\n閉めてなかったかも！　ちょっと気になってきました！","zh":"好的♪　……啊，不过，我可能没有好好把家里的门\n锁上！　有点开始在意起来了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1276.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"abaf2b2885f8d48060667271730794f326c0160c56b11ec07eede47a13e57269","ja":"えっ！？　そ、それは心配ね……。","zh":"咦！？那、那真让人担心呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
